Subject: [PATCH 11/13] feat(repeat-tool-reminder): add hard repeat and
 per-turn caps

Adds blockAt and maxTrackedCallsPerTurn as opt-in hard boundaries returned as ordinary pre-execution denials, validated as integers >= 0 and cleared by a new user message. The dsh base bundle turns them on (8 / 24) as a stopgap against self-reply loops.
